{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"idle\" datamodel=\"null\">\n  <state id=\"idle\">\n    <onentry><assign location=\"count\" expr=\"0\"/></onentry>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml037-null-assign.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml037-null-assign.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":35,"byteOffset":127,"endColumn":49,"endLine":3,"startColumn":14,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the `<assign>` element"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}},{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml037-null-assign.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":4,"byteOffset":87,"endColumn":92,"endLine":1,"startColumn":88,"startLine":1},"insertedContent":{"text":"ecmascript"}}]}],"description":{"text":"select the ECMAScript data model"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml037-null-assign.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":21,"endLine":3,"startColumn":15,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the null data model does not support `<assign>`\n\n**Note:** SCXML 1.0 §B.1.7: the `<foreach>` element and the elements of section 5 (`<datamodel>`, `<data>`, `<assign>`, `<donedata>`, `<content>`, `<param>`, `<script>`) are not supported in the null data model\n\n**Help:** remove the `<assign>`, or select a data model that supports it, such as `datamodel=\"ecmascript\"`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.1 The Null Data Model","text":"the null data model does not support `<assign>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":134,"start":128},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the null data model is selected here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml037-null-assign.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":92,"endLine":1,"startColumn":88,"startLine":1}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML037"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML 1.0 §B.1.7: \"The <foreach> element and the elements defined in 5 Data Model and Data Manipulation are not supported in the Null Data Model.\" A conformant document \"MUST conform to any additional syntactic constraints that are defined for the data model that it has chosen\" (§A.1), and no run-time behavior is defined for these elements. Expressions under the null data model are the `SCXML079` warning"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: remove the section 5 elements (`<datamodel>`, `<data>`, `<assign>`, `<donedata>`, `<content>`, `<param>`, `<script>`) and `<foreach>`, or select a data model such as `ecmascript`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §B.1 The Null Data Model\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML037` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#minimal-profile","id":"SCXML037","name":"SCXML037","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the null data model is used with an element it does not support"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}